# assets/ is BOTH the game's authored asset tree AND the game dir we run retail
# out of: Jointops.exe, binkw32.dll, the retail runtime's own writes (game.cfg,
# player.sav, _filelog.txt, SYSDUMP.TXT, score.ini, ...), and the generated
# packaging output all land here beside our sources.
#
# So this is a BLANKET ignore with an explicit allowlist of the files we author.
# It is deliberately a list of NAMES WE ALLOW, never a list of names we exclude:
# a denylist here once let loose retail copies slip into a commit. Adding an
# asset means adding a line, and that is the point -- it forces the call to be
# made consciously rather than by a wildcard that also sweeps in retail data.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md

# --- Boot: the fatal set + menu strings (RTXT .bin) ---
!/gameerr.bin
!/gametext.bin
!/vmacros.bin
!/keyhelp.bin
!/menutxt.bin

# --- Pre-archive error text: read loose before any mount ---
# Retail reads this before a single archive is open, so it can never live inside one; without
# it the dialog degrades to "Error: Unable to open EARLYERR.TXT"
# [orig: Game_ShowEarlyError @ 0x4a68a0]. Lines 3 and 4 are the no-archives and
# missing-gameerr.bin messages. CRLF, like every authored text file here.
!/earlyerr.txt

# --- Music: the two script + bank pairs, loaded by name ---
!/menumus.sbf
!/menumus.bin
!/gamemus.sbf
!/gamemus.bin

# --- Fonts: the boot face set ---
# Retail looks these up by these exact names off a hardcoded table; a missing one is a null
# slot that draws nothing at all [orig: HUD_InitAllFonts @ 0x51ee20].
!/Arial12b.fnt
!/Arial14n.fnt
!/Arial14b.fnt
!/Arial16n.fnt
!/Arial16b.fnt
!/Impac22b.fnt
!/Impac38b.fnt

# --- Definitions (plain text) ---
!/items.def
!/weapon.def
!/ammo.def

# --- Menus + stylesheet + cursor ---
!/main.mnu
!/mp.mnu
!/sp.mnu
!/menu_style.mns
!/newarow1.tga

# --- The mnml map: mission, terrain, environment, companions, source art ---
!/mnml.bms
!/mnml.trn
!/mnml.env
!/mnml.bin
!/mnml.dbf
!/mnml.lwf
!/mnml.pcx
!/mnml_c.tga
!/mnml_dm.tga
!/mnml.cpt
!/mnml_dc1.tga
!/mnml_dc2.tga
!/mnml_dc3.tga
!/mnml_dmd.tga
!/mnml_d1.tga
!/mnml_t.tga
!/mnml_m.pcx
!/mnml_f.pcx

# --- Modelling sources (src/) ---------------------------------------------
# .blend / .ase and their texture sources live in a SUBDIR, not the flat game
# dir: retail resolves bare filenames at this root under /d, so anything here
# is a file retail might try to load. src/ is ours alone, which is also why it
# can be allowed wholesale -- no retail file ever lands there. Compiled .3di
# and their .TGA textures DO go at the root (the engine loads them by
# `graphic` + ".3di"), so they get allowlisted by name like everything else.
!/src/
!/src/**
